# Local user data — sentinel files that should NEVER be committed even if
# someone accidentally puts them in the repo. Defense in depth.
holdings.md
lifetime-earnings.md
transactions/
fu-money-log/
*-private.md

# Real-data validation artifacts — design-log entries derived from the
# skill author's actual financial data. Contains specific dollar amounts,
# client / vendor names, contract details. Structural lessons get folded
# into the corresponding SKILL.md status-history + Step content; the raw
# findings stay local. Convention: any _design-log file with "real-data"
# in the name is private.
_design-log/*real-data*
